Shuru ki jagah se function chunne ka aasan qaida:
sab se upar se shuru: \(a + b\cos(ct)\);
sab se neeche se shuru: \(a - b\cos(ct)\);
beech (midline) se upar jate hue: \(a + b\sin(ct)\).
Model banane ke baad hamesha \(t = 0\) rakh kar dekhein: shuru ki unchai milni chahiye. Yeh ek second ka check bohat si ghaltiyon se bachata hai.
